0..70 Comment "//! `independent` forks two tasks whose plays do not order each other."
71..74 Comment "//!"
75..148 Comment "//! Each task sends notes on its end. Each channel web is series-parallel"
149..174 Comment "//! without a prime node."
175..178 Comment "//!"
179..259 Comment "//! The parent joins the tasks in reverse fork order. The annotations state each"
260..286 Comment "//! channel\'s prime count."
287..290 Comment "//!"
